{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121036","id":4005304782,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7uvBnO","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121036","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121036.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121036.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121036","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121036/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121036/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121036/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/21bc715f32477afd4e6664ea4522c96db9b0165f","number":121036,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix leaks from expanded Array and Dict from parentless buttons on invisible slots","user":{"login":"DeltachangeOG","id":66188483,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTg4NDgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66188483?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltachangeOG","html_url":"https://github.com/DeltachangeOG","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltachangeOG/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltachangeOG/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltachangeOG/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltachangeOG/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltachangeOG/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltachangeOG/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltachangeOG/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltachangeOG/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeltachangeOG/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #120035\r\n_Bugsquad edit:_ Closes #121031\r\n\r\nWhen Dict or Array are expanded in the editor, slots up to page size are also created with buttons that don't have parents. Once the slot is made visible the buttons are reparented with add_inline_control(). However if slot is invisible buttons are never parented and leak.\r\n\r\nFix was to immediately parent the buttons on creation as add_inline_control safely reparents them once the slot is visible.\r\n\r\nTesting included logging arrays with less than pagesize(20) items and the leaks grew smaller as more items were added. No leak occurs when a multiple of pagesize items exist. After parenting the buttons existing editor behavior remained unchanged and no RID /ObjectDB leaks were reported.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/user